{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>**A student team project designed to deliver a ~10 minute experience.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ESC/APE</strong> throws you into the role of Abe, a genetically enhanced ape bred for combat and locked away in a sterile testing facility. After a lifetime of experiments, you\u2019re finally given a chance to prove your worth, and the chance to break free!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049320/extras/487255f73a7b55ca696201511d819e5c.poster.avif?t=1760642097\" width=900 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049320/extras/487255f73a7b55ca696201511d819e5c.webm?t=1760642097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049320/extras/487255f73a7b55ca696201511d819e5c.mp4?t=1760642097\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master momentum and raw power in fast-paced, physics-driven combat. Slide under hazards, ground pound enemies into the floor, and hurl objects; or your foes themselves, into walls with bone-crushing force. Every movement is a weapon, and every trial pushes your abilities to the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049320/extras/239918d5fcf42ca95277416a6ffb29e7.poster.avif?t=1760642097\" width=900 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049320/extras/239918d5fcf42ca95277416a6ffb29e7.webm?t=1760642097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be just another specimen in the lab\u2019s endless experiments, or the first to shatter its walls and escape?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049320/extras/a65e599824552b60b9b36ae604bc0e5d.poster.avif?t=1760642097\" width=900 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049320/extras/a65e599824552b60b9b36ae604bc0e5d.webm?t=1760642097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4049320?t=1760642097","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049320/9c09891a13d37384f8fcc6cee05ee53b73de7e69/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760642097","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049320/8a625e1455e08dffcb1b1973eb6297f2fb219f8f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760642097","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049320/8a625e1455e08dffcb1b1973eb6297f2fb219f8f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760642097","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>**A student team project designed to deliver a ~10 minute experience.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ESC/APE</strong> throws you into the role of Abe, a genetically enhanced ape bred for combat and locked away in a sterile testing facility. After a lifetime of experiments, you\u2019re finally given a chance to prove your worth, and the chance to break free!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.c